	<h3><i class="icon icon-credit-card"></i> {l s='Easy Google Address Autocomplete' mod='op_googleauto'}</h3>
	<p>
		{l s='Enhance your Prestashop checkout and user experience with our Google address auto complete module. As a customer begins to type their address,Easy Google auto complete will kick in and suggest addresses. Once an address is selected the additional fields such as town and postcode will auto fill, speeding up the checkout process!
' mod='op_googleauto'}	</p>
		<h2>{l s='Setup' mod='op_googleauto'}</h2>
		<ul> <li>{l s='Goto' mod='op_googleauto'} <a href='https://console.cloud.google.com' traget="_blank">https://console.cloud.google.com </a>{l s='and login with your Google Account or create an account.' mod='op_googleauto'} </li>
<li>{l s='Create a Project on Google Cloud Console.' mod='op_googleauto'}</li>
<li>{l s='Enable the following API\'s on your project:' mod='op_googleauto'} <pre> Maps Javascript API , Places API</pre></li>
<li>{l s='You will have to setup the Google Billing account as well.' mod='op_googleauto'}</li></li>
<li>{l s='Create a Key named HTTP Key and under the website restrictions tab add your website URL like the following
If your website is my-domain.com add this:' mod='op_googleauto'} <b>https://my-domain.com/*</b></li>
</ul>

